chown - change file owner or group

SYNOPSIS
    chown uid[:gid] file ...
    chown :gid file ...

DESCRIPTION
    Root may set any numeric UID or GID. A file owner may set its group
    to their own primary group.

EXAMPLES
    chown :7350 /tmp/shared

SEE ALSO
    chmod(1), statx(2)
